OL,3,GNEWSAEarl Spencer's accused stalker due
OL,4,Ato stand trial
OL,5,
OL,6,FA woman who has denied stalking Earl
OL,7,FSpencer by sending handwritten letters
OL,8,Fand repeatedly visiting his home is due
OL,9,Fto stand trial in April.
OL,11,FMarinela Atomei, 44, appeared at
OL,12,FWarwick Crown Court on Monday in
OL,13,Frelation to the charge, which
OL,14,Fprosecutors allege caused Earl Spencer,
OL,15,F62, the brother of the late Diana,
OL,16,FPrincess of Wales, serious alarm or
OL,17,Fdistress.
OL,19,FThe hearing was told Atomei visited the
OL,20,FAlthorp estate on numerous occasions
OL,21,Fwhen it was open to members of the
OL,22,Fpublic in July and August 2025.
OL,23,APub: 05-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
