OL,3,GNEWSAEarl Spencer's accused stalker due
OL,4,Ato stand trial
OL,5,
OL,6,FAtomei, of Penny Hapenny Court in
OL,7,FAtherstone, Warwickshire, was released
OL,8,Fon bail and was told not to enter
OL,9,FNorthamptonshire and she would continue
OL,10,Fto be monitored by an electronic tag.
